msgid "**\"Service\"** means all websites, software and services offered and operated by UdL in connection with the provision of the Data Portal from time to time."
msgstr "**\"Service\"** means all websites, software and services offered and operated by UdL in connection with the provision of the Data Portal from time to time."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/i18n/legalMessages.ts
