msgstr "**\"UdL Content\"** means software or data which UdL is entitled to."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/i18n/legalMessages.ts
msgid "**\"UdL\"** means Universitat de Lleida, Víctor Siurana 1, 25003 Lleida, Spain, as provider of the Data Portal."
msgstr "**\"UdL\"** means Universitat de Lleida, Víctor Siurana 1, 25003 Lleida, Spain, as provider of the Data Portal."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/i18n/legalMessages.ts
msgid "**\"Website\"** means the website at [https://market.agrospai.udl.cat](https://market.agrospai.udl.cat) (and any successor or related site designated by UdL), as may be updated by UdL from time to time."
msgstr "**\"Website\"** means the website at [https://market.agrospai.udl.cat](https://market.agrospai.udl.cat) (and any successor or related site designated by UdL), as may be updated by UdL from time to time."

