msgstr "**4.1** If a Customer elects to publish or consume Service Offerings on the Data Portal, which includes the generation and purchase of the respective Service Offering Token, it will be conducted solely through EVM Compatible Blockchains via compatible Web3 wallets. UdL will have no insight into or control over these activities, nor does UdL have the ability to reverse any of these or any transaction resulting therefrom."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/i18n/legalMessages.ts
msgid "**4.2 Providing portal demonstrator functionalities**  \n"
