#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/i18n/legalMessages.ts
msgid "**4.2** EVM Compatible Blockchains may require the payment of a Gas Fee for every transaction occurring. The Gas Fee typically funds the network of computers that run the EVM Compatible Blockchains. This means that the Customer will need to pay a Gas Fee for each transaction that occurs via the Data Portal and transacting via the Data Portal will require an accordingly funded wallet."
msgstr "**4.2** EVM Compatible Blockchains may require the payment of a Gas Fee for every transaction occurring. The Gas Fee typically funds the network of computers that run the EVM Compatible Blockchains. This means that the Customer will need to pay a Gas Fee for each transaction that occurs via the Data Portal and transacting via the Data Portal will require an accordingly funded wallet."

